  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-08",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "艺人通道执勤  (On Duty at the Artist Entrance)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "agent": "经纪人",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Backstage at Studio One, floor director Lin Jie greets veteran singer Li Mingji's manager while Bu Xiaogu asks to help at the artist entrance. Listen to their Mandarin conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "您好，我是李铭基先生的经纪人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "您好，这边请。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "林姐，前台这边我不太熟悉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去艺人通道那边帮忙吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "上面交代不让你去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "凯文交代，入职不到一年的新制片都不能去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "但是我们这儿只有你一个新人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那边的布局还是我调整的，您上周还说我熟那边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "辛惠美来的时候也是我负责执勤的，我没有出一点错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "好好好，你去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢林姐！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "您好，我是李铭基先生的经纪人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, I am Mr Li Mingji's manager.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "您好，这边请。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, right this way please.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "林姐，前台这边我不太熟悉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Lin Jie, I am not very familiar with the front desk here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我去艺人通道那边帮忙吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me go help over at the artist corridor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "上面交代不让你去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Management instructed me not to send you there.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why is that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "凯文交代，入职不到一年的新制片都不能去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen said no new producer with under a year on the job may go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "但是我们这儿只有你一个新人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet around here, you are our only newcomer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那边的布局还是我调整的，您上周还说我熟那边。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I adjusted the layout over there myself, and last week you said I knew it well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "辛惠美来的时候也是我负责执勤的，我没有出一点错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was on duty when Xin Huimei came too, and I did not make a single mistake.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "好好好，你去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, go ahead.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢林姐！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, Lin Jie!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "您好，我是李铭基先生的经纪人。",
      "gap": 0.5
